    "body": "## Problem\n\nA completion list default edit range can replace the explicit range of an `InsertReplaceEdit`, filtering out valid items or changing their replacement.\n\n## Solution\n\nOnly synthesize a default text edit when the completion item has none.\n\nExtend the existing `itemDefaults` test for explicit edits with both range variants.",
